# Deadwind Pass - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The zone's whole census is one quest: the data holds no quest that accepts
# from any of Deadwind's 34 NPCs or 39 objects, and no quest objectives any
# of them. What exists is a single sourceless tailoring writ turning in at
# Hastings. Run this in its own tab at 60 whenever the writ is to hand.
guide butler-routes-completionist/deadwind-pass
title Deadwind Pass
levels 60-60
zone Deadwind Pass
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Eastern Kingdoms
coords live
version 1

step Hastings - the Tuxedo Jacket writ

  zone map 1430

  note One quest lives in Deadwind Pass in the data: the Craftsman's Writ below. Ride in from Duskwood to the west or the Swamp of Sorrows to the east; Hastings waits at the roadside south of the crossroads.
  note The writ item (264155) has no source anywhere in the data - no drops, no vendors - so have the writ and a Tuxedo Jacket (10036) in your bags before you come; nothing here can supply them.
  goto 46.99,75.32
  accept 94355 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Tuxedo Jacket - Hastings; have the writ and the jacket in your bags
  turnin 94355 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Tuxedo Jacket - Hastings
